achievement("An assassin's credo",v_ac_b3_ch6_credo)
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 1 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 1) {
Kate sways aside as steel whispers past her ear. The black-robed assassin materializes in bursts, launching conjured blades at her and Illuna while maintaining a flurry of dagger strikes. Kate deflects the incoming steel with localized frost plates, keeping her ranged icicles focused on the ambassador's ice wall to prevent a retreat.

Illuna abruptly freezes in place. She drops her guard and stares straight at the assassin as his dagger arcs toward her throat.

The blade halts an inch from her skin. The assassin blinks, then teleports beside Kate to strike again. Kate mimics Illuna, freezing mid-step.

The phantom assassin goes rigid, his conjured blades hovering motionless in midair.

"Cheap phantasm," Illuna mutters, driving two water lances into the captain's barrier as the phantom dissolves into mist. "Keep the pressure on the ambassador. As long as the captain holds that dome, he cannot pin our movement."

An illusion. Glad they caught the tell before burning their reserves.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 0 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 1) {
As I drop toward the street, Illuna abruptly freezes in place, dropping her guard while the assassin's dagger arcs toward her throat.

The blade halts an inch from her skin. The assassin blinks, then teleports beside Kate to strike again. Kate mimics Illuna, freezing mid-step.

The phantom assassin goes rigid, his conjured blades hovering motionless in midair.

"Cheap phantasm," Illuna mutters, driving two water lances into the captain's barrier as the phantom dissolves into mist. "Keep the pressure on the ambassador. As long as the captain holds that dome, he cannot pin our movement."

An illusion. Glad they caught the tell before burning their reserves.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 2 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 1) {
As I drop toward the street, Illuna abruptly freezes in place, dropping her guard while the assassin's dagger arcs toward her throat.

The blade halts an inch from her skin. The assassin blinks, then teleports beside Kate to strike again. Kate mimics Illuna, freezing mid-step.

The phantom assassin goes rigid, his conjured blades hovering motionless in midair.

"Cheap phantasm," Illuna mutters, driving two water lances into the captain's barrier as the phantom dissolves into mist. "Keep the pressure on the ambassador. As long as the captain holds that dome, he cannot pin our movement."

An illusion. Glad they caught the tell before burning their reserves.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 1 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_b3_ch5_fight >= 4) {
Kate twists away, but the blade's tip grazes her right shoulder, opening a shallow red line along the leather. Ignoring the sting, she continues firing frost javelins at the ambassador's retreat.

The robed assassin conjures four blades, hurling them at Kate as Illuna lashes out with water whips. Flower maintains a steady rain of fire arrows on the captain's barrier to pin him in place.

Without warning, the assassin's head separates cleanly from his shoulders. Blood geysers into the air; the conjured blades clatter harmlessly to the pavement as his corpse thuds onto the cobblestones.

I land beside Kate, addressing the empty air in front of us.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 0 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_b3_ch5_fight >= 4) {
As I drop toward the street, the black-robed assassin's head separates cleanly from his shoulders. Blood geysers into the air; the conjured blades clatter harmlessly to the pavement as his corpse thuds onto the cobblestones.

I land beside Kate, addressing the empty air in front of us.

}
