I land beside Kate, addressing the empty air in front of us.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 1 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_b3_ch5_fight < 4) {
Kate twists away, but the blade's tip grazes her right shoulder, opening a shallow red line along the leather. Ignoring the sting, she continues firing frost javelins at the ambassador's retreat.

The robed assassin conjures four blades, hurling them at Kate as Illuna lashes out with water whips. Flower maintains a steady rain of fire arrows on the captain's barrier to pin him in place.

"Kate and Illuna have their hands full," I tell Daren and Leila. "I will flank him."

I break away from their shield, diving at the assassin's blind spot. He anticipates the vector, teleporting directly into my flight path with his left palm open. A thick jet of corrosive acid sprays straight for my throat.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 0 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_b3_ch5_fight < 4) {
The assassin anticipates my vector, teleporting directly into my flight path with his left palm open. A thick jet of corrosive acid sprays straight for my throat.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 2 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_b3_ch5_fight < 4) {
The assassin anticipates my vector, teleporting directly into my flight path with his left palm open. A thick jet of corrosive acid sprays straight for my throat.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_preparing == 1) {
With the robed threat resolved, I touch down beside Kate and Illuna to read the line.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_b3_ch5_fight >= 4) {
"About time you stepped in, Albert," I say. "Thought you had deserted."

"A professional strikes only when the kill is guaranteed," Albert's voice floats from the empty cobblestones.

"In short, you only act when there is zero risk to yourself?"

"Naturally."

"Appreciate the honesty."

With the assassin dead, I touch down beside Kate and Illuna to read the line.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_aura_hardening < 3 && v_b3_ch5_fight < 4) {
The acid dissolves skin and trachea in seconds. Agonizing heat floods my chest as my airway collapses, dragging me into darkness.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 0 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_aura_hardening >= 3 && v_b3_ch5_fight < 4) {
Hardened aura absorbs the corrosive blast, leaving only a sharp sting on my forearms. I wipe the burning sludge from my vambraces and snap my wrist, flinging the acid back into the assassin's eyes.

The caustic liquid catches him unprepared. He teleports blindly to the pavement, clutching his face with a muffled shriek of agony.

The pause is fatal. Illuna snaps a high-velocity water whip across the gap, severing his head in a single stroke.

I exchange a nod with Illuna as she refocuses her barrage on the captain alongside Kate and Flower.

I touch down on the cobblestones to read the line.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 1 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_aura_hardening >= 3 && v_b3_ch5_fight < 4 || v_b3_ch6_focus == 2 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 0 && v_aura_hardening >= 3 && v_b3_ch5_fight < 4) {
Hardened aura absorbs the corrosive blast, leaving only a sharp sting on my forearms. I wipe the burning sludge from my vambraces and snap my wrist, flinging the acid back into the assassin's eyes.

The caustic liquid catches him unprepared. He teleports blindly to the pavement, clutching his face with a muffled shriek of agony.

The pause is fatal. Illuna snaps a high-velocity water whip across the gap, severing his head in a single stroke.

I exchange a nod with Illuna as she refocuses her barrage on the captain alongside Kate and Flower.

I touch down on the cobblestones to read the line.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 0 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 1 || v_b3_ch6_focus == 0 && v_aura_hardening >= 3 || v_b3_ch6_focus == 0 && v_b3_ch5_fight >= 4) {
The hovering boulders above begin to wheel into tight ballistic trajectories. The elementalist is readying an all-out bombardment.

"Boulders are rotating into firing arcs," I call out to Kate and Illuna. "We need defensive barriers now."

"I can raise a wind dome, but cluster inside five paces," Melindra says.

Kate, Flower, Kelrim, and I close in around Melindra. Shimmering translucent air currents wrap around our perimeter.

"I want to keep hammering the captain until Melindra's shield cracks," Kate says, frost coating her palms. "If he pins us while granite falls from the clouds, we are finished."

"Can you make the ice dome translucent enough to maintain target lines?" I ask.

"Yes," Kate says, "but channeling reinforcement into the dome thins my offensive icicles. It opens a window for the captain to counter."

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 1 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 1 || v_b3_ch6_focus == 1 && v_aura_hardening >= 3 || v_b3_ch6_focus == 1 && v_b3_ch5_fight >= 4 || v_b3_ch6_focus == 2 && v_b3_ch6_preparing == 1 || v_b3_ch6_focus == 2 && v_aura_hardening >= 3 || v_b3_ch6_focus == 2 && v_b3_ch5_fight >= 4) {
High above, the suspended quarry has doubled in mass. Hundreds of reinforced stone projectiles float in formation, drifting into ballistic arcs.

"Boulders are rotating into firing arcs," I call out to Kate and Illuna. "We need defensive barriers now."

"I can raise a wind dome, but cluster inside five paces," Melindra says.

Kate, Flower, Kelrim, and I close in around Melindra. Shimmering translucent air currents wrap around our perimeter.

"I want to keep hammering the captain until Melindra's shield cracks," Kate says, frost coating her palms. "If he pins us while granite falls from the clouds, we are finished."

"Can you make the ice dome translucent enough to maintain target lines?" I ask.

"Yes," Kate says, "but channeling reinforcement into the dome thins my offensive icicles. It opens a window for the captain to counter."

}
