#if(v_b3_ch6_air == 0 && v_b3_ch6_tie == 0 && v_b3_ch6_uninjured == 0) {


"Arraka," I whisper, straining against the cobblestones. "Highlight the aura nodes like yesterday so Kate can pierce them."

"He is cycling the flow continuously," Arraka snarls from the amulet. "He learned from his mistake."

A lattice of radiant gold bars manifests around the captain and the ambassador, locking them in a containment cage conjured by Illuna. The crushing pressure pinning us does not waver.

"What are you doing?!" Arraka roars. "A static cage against an aura manipulator?! Did you sleep through every lesson?!"

"Familiar weave," the captain muses, tapping a fingertip to a golden bar. "Highly susceptible to harmonic resonance."

He executes a quick circular wrist flick. The golden bars warp into twisting spirals, blur into high-frequency oscillation, and dissolve into nothing.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_air == 0 && v_b3_ch6_tie == 0 && v_b3_ch6_uninjured == 1) {


"Daren," I whisper. "Try the recall weave with your left hand."

"On it," Daren grunts.

The broadsword scrapes across the cobblestones toward us, then abruptly reverses direction and snaps into the captain's raised left hand.

"Not happening," the captain says, tossing it aside. "The steel stays with me."

A lattice of radiant gold bars manifests around the captain and the ambassador, locking them in a containment cage conjured by Illuna. The crushing pressure pinning us does not waver.

"What are you doing?!" Arraka roars. "A static cage against an aura manipulator?! Did you sleep through every lesson?!"

"Familiar weave," the captain muses, tapping a fingertip to a golden bar. "Highly susceptible to harmonic resonance."

He executes a quick circular wrist flick. The golden bars warp into twisting spirals, blur into high-frequency oscillation, and dissolve into nothing.

}
