}
#if(v_b3_ch6_air >= 1) {
"You should have studied harder under your amulet spirit," the captain says, meeting Illuna's glare. "Wasted effort."

The ambassador scurries down the street toward the south alley. Kate fires two icicles from the dirt, but the captain's mobile shield deflects both. The ambassador rounds the corner into safety.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_air == 0 && v_b3_ch6_tie == 1) {
"You should have studied harder under your amulet spirit," the captain says, meeting Illuna's glare. "Wasted effort."

Felsig reaches the alley wall and carves a clean archway through Kate's ice with overlapping wind scythes. The ambassador ducks through the breach. Kate launches a final frost spike, but the captain parries it with a localized shield. The ambassador is clear.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_air == 0 && v_b3_ch6_tie == 0 && v_combat_technique < 2) {
"You should have studied harder under your amulet spirit," the captain says, meeting Illuna's glare. "Wasted effort."

Felsig reaches the alley wall and carves a clean archway through Kate's ice with overlapping wind scythes. The ambassador ducks through the breach. Kate launches a final frost spike, but the captain parries it with a localized shield. The ambassador is clear.

Loyrang finally ambles into position, drawing a broadsword with an easy, relaxed posture.

"No hard feelings, mate," Loyrang mutters, kneeling beside me. "Have to make it look convincing."

He drives the point cleanly into my right shoulder. White-hot agony flares through my chest; blood wells around the blade and spills across the stones.

"Oof," Loyrang whistles under his breath. "That is a deep puncture. Put pressure on that before you bleed dry."

"Loyrang, execute them, stop playing!" the captain barks.

"Right, Captain," Loyrang says, stepping back with his weapon lowered.

The captain amplifies the downward kinetic load. The sheer gravitational pressure clamps onto my shoulder, sealing the wound by brute compression.

"I avoid this level of compression due to the strain on an aging body," the captain says coldly, "but a week in bed is a fair trade. No more tricks. Die with dignity."

The force escalates. Ribs crack under the load; screams tear from our throats across the avenue.

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_air == 0 && v_b3_ch6_tie == 0 && v_combat_technique >= 2) {
