ID: B3-Ch06b-Tactical
TEXT:

"The captain is down," Daren calls out. "Clean up the line."

"The captain is dead?!" Gontrok roars from down the avenue, nearly eating Hadrik's overhand right from the distraction. "Tactical withdrawal!"

"You think you walk away from this?!" Hadrik barks, doubling his striking tempo.

"I am not asking your leave," Gontrok sneers, ducking beneath a sweeping hook. "We are extracting whether you like it or not."

#if(v_b3_ch6_focus == 1 && v_b3_ch6_selected != 3) {
"Touch that beacon and I report you, Gontrok," the untraceable voice from earlier echoes across the street. "Guard teleporters are restricted to royal defense."

"Is that so?" Gontrok grunts, fumbling beneath his tunic with one hand while backpedaling from Hadrik. "Did not stop the king from using them on a whim yesterday. If he abuses the hardware, so do I."

"We do not retreat, coward!" the voice roars. "We avenge our captain!"

}
#if(v_b3_ch6_selected == 3 || v_b3_ch6_focus != 1) {
"Touch that beacon and I report you, Gontrok," an untraceable voice echoes across the street. "Guard teleporters are restricted to royal defense."

