ID: B3-Ch06b-Leave
TEXT:

"Not worth chasing the ambassador," I say. "Let us extract while our relay is clear."

"Agreed," Daren says. "Fresh squads or jammer wards could deploy at any second. We take no unnecessary gambles."

#if(v_b3_ch6_kelrim != 1 && v_b3_ch6_plan != 3) {
We hold position for thirty seconds while the operator calibrates the lock. Daren cradles Kelrim's body in his arms to bring him home.

}
